{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom liquid block called "Nuevos productos carrusel". Display all store products sorted by newest first using collections.all.products with sort_by: created-descending. Do NOT use a collection picker.
    
    CRITICAL — Exact HTML structure (do not alter):
    
    outer-wrapper
      └── clip-wrapper
            └── scroll-container
                  └── flex-row
                        └── cards
    Exact CSS for each container (hardcoded, do not use settings for these):
    
    outer-wrapper {
      overflow: visible;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 48px 0;
      display: block;
    }
    
    clip-wrapper {
      overflow: hidden;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 56px;
      margin: 0 -56px;
      box-sizing: content-box;
    }
    
    scroll-container {
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 32px 56px 32px 56px;
      margin: -32px -56px -32px -56px;
      width: calc(100% + 112px);
      scrollbar-width: none;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      -ms-overflow-style: none;
    }
    
    scroll-container::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    
    flex-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    This exact structure is mandatory. Do not simplify, merge, or alter any of these containers or their CSS values.
    
    Card sizing:
    
    Mobile: flex: 0 0 calc(45vw - 8px)
    Desktop (min-width 750px): flex: 0 0 calc(22% - 8px)
    scroll-snap-align: start on each card
    Image format:
    
    3:4 portrait ratio — padding-top: 133.33%, relative container, absolute image inside
    object-fit: cover
    overflow: hidden on image container
    Border-radius from card_border_radius setting
    ULTRA PREMIUM animations (all mandatory, do not simplify):
    
    Page load — staggered entrance:
    
    Start state: opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.95) rotateX(8deg);
    End state: opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1) rotateX(0deg);
    Duration: 0.8s
    Easing: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) (expo-out — premium feel)
    animation-fill-mode: both
    transform-origin: bottom center
    perspective: 800px on the flex-row container
    Stagger: 120ms per card using Liquid nth-child loop for all 24 possible cards
    Hover state (desktop):
    
    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.03)
    Background → hover_background_color
    All texts → hover_text_color
    Shadow intensifies to hover settings
    Image zooms: transform: scale(1.1) inside overflow-hidden container
    Transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Shadow transition separately: box-shadow 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Active/press state:
    
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.01)
    Shadow reduces slightly
    Transition: all 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) — snappy press feel
    Touch (mobile) — :active state mirrors hover for touch feedback
    
    Image hover zoom:
    
    transform: scale(1.1)
    transition: transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Must stay inside overflow: hidden container — never bleeds outside card
    Text: all card text always text-align: center — no exceptions
    
    Theme editor settings:
    
    Heading:
    
    heading_text — text, default "Nuevos productos"
    heading_color — color picker
    heading_size — range 16–48, default 24
    heading_alignment — select left/center/right, default center
    Card texts:
    
    card_title_color — color picker
    card_title_size — range 12–24, default 14
    card_price_color — color picker
    card_price_size — range 12–22, default 14
    card_vendor_color — color picker
    show_price — checkbox, default true
    show_vendor — checkbox, default false
    Hover colors:
    
    hover_background_color — color picker, default #1a1a1a
    hover_text_color — color picker, default #ffffff
    Shadow — normal state:
    
    shadow_color — color picker, default #000000
    shadow_opacity — range 0–30, default 8
    shadow_offset_x — range -20 to 20, default 0
    shadow_offset_y — range 0–30, default 6
    shadow_blur — range 0–80, default 20
    shadow_spread — range -10 to 20, default 0
    Shadow — hover state:
    
    hover_shadow_opacity — range 0–40, default 22
    hover_shadow_blur — range 0–100, default 48
    hover_shadow_spread — range -10 to 20, default 4
    hover_shadow_offset_y — range 0–40, default 14
    Card layout:
    
    card_background — color picker, default #ffffff
    card_border_radius — range 0–32, default 14
    card_padding — range 8–32, default 14
    products_to_show — range 4–24, default 8
    Non-negotiable requirements:
    
    Exact 3-container structure with exact CSS values — mandatory
    perspective: 800px on flex-row for 3D entrance animation
    rotateX in entrance animation for premium depth feel
    Images always 3:4 portrait
    All text always centered
    No hardcoded colors or shadow values — all from settings
    Layout always horizontal, never vertical
    All easings cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) — no linear or ease-in-out
    Do NOT add overflow-x: hidden to body or any parent outside this block
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign sorted_products = collections.all.products | sort: 'created_at' | reverse %}

{% style %}
  .ai-nuevos-productos-outer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow: visible;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 48px 0;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-clip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 56px;
    margin: 0 -56px;
    box-sizing: content-box;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 32px 56px 32px 56px;
    margin: -32px -56px -32px -56px;
    width: calc(100% + 112px);
    scrollbar-width: none;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-flex-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    gap: 16px;
    perspective: 800px;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc(45vw - 8px);
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.95) rotateX(8deg);
    animation: ai-nuevos-productos-entrance-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
    transform-origin: bottom center;
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_y }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_spread }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(22% - 8px);
    }

    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.03);
      background-color: {{ block.settings.hover_background_color }};
      box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_offset_y }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_spread }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', block.settings.hover_shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    }

    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      color: {{ block.settings.hover_text_color }};
    }

    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-nuevos-productos-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }

    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
      transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.01);
      box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_y | plus: 3 }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur | times: 0.8 }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_spread }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
      transition: all 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
      transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.03);
      background-color: {{ block.settings.hover_background_color }};
      box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_offset_y }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_spread }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', block.settings.hover_shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    }

    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active .ai-nuevos-productos-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active .ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active .ai-nuevos-productos-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      color: {{ block.settings.hover_text_color }};
    }

    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active .ai-nuevos-productos-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-nuevos-productos-entrance-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.95) rotateX(8deg);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1) rotateX(0deg);
    }
  }

  {% for i in (1..24) %}
    .ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child({{ i }}) {
      animation-delay: {{ i | minus: 1 | times: 120 }}ms;
    }
  {% endfor %}

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: 133.33%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    transition: color 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_price_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_price_size }}px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    transition: color 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-nuevos-productos-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_vendor_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_price_size | minus: 2 }}px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0;
    transition: color 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
{% endstyle %}

<nuevos-productos-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-nuevos-productos-outer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.heading_text != blank %}
    <h2 class="ai-nuevos-productos-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_text }}</h2>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-clip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-flex-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for product in sorted_products limit: block.settings.products_to_show %}
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if product.featured_image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="600"
                  height="800"
                >
              {% else %}
                <img
                  src="{{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag | split: 'svg' | first | append: 'svg style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"' | append: product.title | split: product.title | first }}"
                  alt="{{ product.title | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                >
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <h3 class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>
            {% if block.settings.show_price %}
              <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.show_vendor and product.vendor != blank %}
              <div class="ai-nuevos-productos-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.vendor }}</div>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</nuevos-productos-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class NuevosProductosCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('nuevos-productos-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', NuevosProductosCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

